{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/47900d6c8f20f0385dfc2f2398e296c6.poster.avif?t=1771874972\" width=802 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/47900d6c8f20f0385dfc2f2398e296c6.webm?t=1771874972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/47900d6c8f20f0385dfc2f2398e296c6.mp4?t=1771874972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radical Zomboarding is a roguelike snowboarding game that's all about shredding powder and shooting zombies. Do tricks, buy perks, and soak the slopes with blood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/a71a30d0bf9af5141bd046a3bec3f286.poster.avif?t=1771874972\" width=802 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/a71a30d0bf9af5141bd046a3bec3f286.webm?t=1771874972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/a71a30d0bf9af5141bd046a3bec3f286.mp4?t=1771874972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like going fast?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting big air?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting zombies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unhinged loading screen tips?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Radical Zomboarding</u></strong><u> has it all!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/9be4998812a550513814c54c49becffc.poster.avif?t=1771874972\" width=802 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/9be4998812a550513814c54c49becffc.webm?t=1771874972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/9be4998812a550513814c54c49becffc.mp4?t=1771874972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode: Roguelike snowboarding where you buy perks, shoot zombies, dodge missiles, complete challenges, and survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen mode: No zombies, no timers, no missiles, no stress! Just enjoy going down the slope at your own pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode: Complete a run with a specific set of rules and perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of unlockable characters, boards, and hats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New slopes that will push your zomboarding skills to the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic cheat codes like the ones you used to play with as a kid!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>And yes, it runs on the Steam Deck!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547020?t=1771874972","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547020?t=1771874972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/d528e88c14cd183b741d5aa5f25bf8cecd06181a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771874972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/d528e88c14cd183b741d5